{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e428fee731f4fd18b3c320cb04d1bb611910625c57ba238a283a00ebca1271fe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d944612f3969b8371003fa649d4844b0b80f278288f24de872938b35f1715978",
      "text": "喂，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n你在工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没事的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e615263d5eec0f0e76f490144962a47a28bc54ce95f5bc2b44fc46cb5f6a2045",
      "text": "那就太好了。\n工作辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7adcf874fb08e981a3729b399eba3a09b2ce847c1559252da92a3b09e833f6f9",
      "text": "刚才我在樱见的图书室里，\n找到了签售会时借的那本书。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00bdc69becbbdb1342662417fda61e9074a7eb172c20f1a42201190de285f1cd",
      "text": "就想起了写留言卡\n那时候的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff6c41af243286491054b831b26ecc5face3c2b7dc73a1de401e0b4a282fc39c",
      "text": "为了找到符合自己风格的话语传达给粉丝，\n当时我可真是大伤脑筋啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7223dd10f174dbad271a0ab546b7919641641bc2870ea2ceb73e4005dbf291b",
      "text": "正因如此，看到从我手里接过卡片的粉丝\n喜笑颜开时，我真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0f4ef41a74afce9dbc982e7e39007cf227d7ea0eef2719c0c947e34557e2b27",
      "text": "能直接向粉丝表达谢意的机会并不多。\n偶尔办办这种活动也挺不错的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d38a3ac50ca0400d907920e63802747058a2db88e2291ee5fdd867f0c343c92",
      "text": "今后我也不会忘记感谢之心，\n继续奋勇向前的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:368f8cbd50e44df6dfca596089ca28163f57795de4515afdd58db161e7ccc7a4",
      "text": "一起努力\n前进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01a374d6da6fd0a4f6a5773e35091365a6194ac2dc6fcf95c8f57bbc38beed73",
      "text": "我也会全力\n支持您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_401_2_4_026_01_09_a:2_4_026_01_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff592e6dda7ce9c2267518b12ad8ed58a192c1ccc9c7afb9b5539960d9aedda",
      "text": "嗯。那么，明天开始也拜托你了，\n●●●●●●●●●●番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
